1
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:13,800
(Let it go.)

2
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:45,960
=Revenge From A Wife=

3
00:00:46,090 --> 00:00:48,320
=Episode 4=

4
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:54,240
(Late Empress Roujia's Memorial Tablet)

5
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:55,759
Roujia.

6
00:00:57,799 --> 00:00:59,399
I remember your words every day.

7
00:01:00,079 --> 00:01:01,240
(Gentle Yet Firm, a Blessing to All)
Each year on this day,

8
00:01:01,759 --> 00:01:03,280
(Virtuous and Prudent, Kind to All)
I set an example,

9
00:01:03,479 --> 00:01:04,920
with my consorts and officials,

10
00:01:05,679 --> 00:01:06,920
keeping our expenses modest

11
00:01:07,479 --> 00:01:09,000
and sharing the people's hardships.

12
00:01:09,880 --> 00:01:10,760
Now Zhao

13
00:01:11,120 --> 00:01:13,359
is well cared for by
your younger sister Yuying.

14
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:15,359
He's safe and well.

15
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:17,560
You can rest easy.

16
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:22,879
Zhao.

17
00:01:23,799 --> 00:01:25,120
Say a few words

18
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:26,920
to your mother too.

19
00:01:27,076 --> 00:01:28,843
(Xiao Zhao, the Late Empress's Son)

20
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:35,000
Please...

21
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,319
stop hitting him.

22
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:39,680
Please, I beg you.

23
00:01:44,959 --> 00:01:45,680
Zhao.

24
00:01:46,159 --> 00:01:47,400
Tomorrow,

25
00:01:47,719 --> 00:01:49,799
say exactly what I taught you,

26
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:51,359
and I

27
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,439
will spare your study companion.

28
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:54,480
I remember.

29
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:55,599
Consort Chen.

30
00:02:04,239 --> 00:02:04,920
Mother.

31
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:07,879
Consort Chen teaches me
to read and write.

32
00:02:08,079 --> 00:02:09,400
She sees to all my daily needs

33
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:10,560
and cares for me in every way.

34
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,840
If you can hear me in heaven,

35
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:12,840
please don't worry.

36
00:02:14,375 --> 00:02:18,795
(Mother of the Realm, Revered by All)

37
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,360
You've been very thoughtful.

38
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:24,479
I was never blessed

39
00:02:24,919 --> 00:02:26,840
to bear Your Majesty a child.

40
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:29,080
All I can do for you and my sister

41
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:30,360
is take good care of Zhao.

42
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:32,919
It's the least I can do.

43
00:02:39,796 --> 00:02:41,856
(Concubine Yu,
the Late Empress's Personal Maid)

44
00:02:52,390 --> 00:02:55,717
(Pure Heart, Serene Mind)

45
00:02:59,086 --> 00:03:02,066
(Pure Heart, Serene Mind)

46
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:05,800
Your Highness.

47
00:03:06,199 --> 00:03:08,280
Consort Chen has a reward for you.

48
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:12,599
Chunjuan!

49
00:03:14,319 --> 00:03:15,039
Your Highness.

50
00:03:15,199 --> 00:03:16,439
How dare you!

51
00:03:17,599 --> 00:03:19,639
I sent Chunjuan
to bring Zhao his cough medicine.

52
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:21,199
Your Highness,

53
00:03:21,199 --> 00:03:22,439
why did you have her killed?

54
00:03:24,159 --> 00:03:25,560
Perhaps back when

55
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,400
you were still my sister's maid,

56
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,599
she never taught you palace etiquette.

57
00:03:30,039 --> 00:03:31,400
Everyone in the palace knows

58
00:03:31,719 --> 00:03:33,199
Zhao is under my care.

59
00:03:33,599 --> 00:03:34,879
Who are you to look after him?

60
00:03:36,039 --> 00:03:37,879
I was only worried about Zhao.

61
00:03:40,879 --> 00:03:42,120
Worried about him?

62
00:03:43,759 --> 00:03:45,719
Did my sister visit you in a dream

63
00:03:46,039 --> 00:03:47,319
and ask you to take Zhao?

64
00:03:48,319 --> 00:03:49,240
Or perhaps

65
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:51,360
you want to join her in the afterlife?

66
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:52,719
I...

67
00:03:52,919 --> 00:03:53,800
I wouldn't dare.

68
00:03:54,159 --> 00:03:55,639
Kneel here until morning.

69
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:57,479
Think carefully

70
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:59,840
about who is raising Zhao.

71
00:04:03,048 --> 00:04:06,148
(Pure Heart, Serene Mind)

72
00:04:10,879 --> 00:04:12,080
I've traveled for three days straight.

73
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,560
Still dusty from the road,

74
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:14,400
I came straight to pay my respects.

75
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,240
I hope Your Majesty

76
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:17,280
will forgive my lack of decorum.

77
00:04:20,319 --> 00:04:21,919
Your devotion is clear, Uncle.

78
00:04:22,079 --> 00:04:23,160
You've done nothing improper.

79
00:04:23,759 --> 00:04:24,839
You come every year,

80
00:04:25,639 --> 00:04:26,839
rain or shine.

81
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:29,079
I remember.

82
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:31,240
I made a promise to the late Empress.

83
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:32,660
(Xiao Zhi, the Emperor's Uncle)

84
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:34,199
I would never forget it.

85
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:37,920
Uncle,

86
00:04:38,199 --> 00:04:39,879
where did you travel this time?

87
00:04:40,160 --> 00:04:41,199
I went to Lingnan.

88
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:43,160
It's a long, mountainous journey,

89
00:04:43,639 --> 00:04:44,399
but it's peaceful there.

90
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:47,319
The people there have it hard.

91
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:50,199
Looking at this cottage now,

92
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,439
I finally understand

93
00:04:52,879 --> 00:04:54,240
what the late Empress meant

94
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:55,959
by sharing the people's hardships.

95
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:58,480
You travel far and wide, Uncle.

96
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:00,240
You're closer to the people

97
00:05:00,839 --> 00:05:02,160
than I am.

98
00:05:03,839 --> 00:05:05,120
I have no official duties.

99
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:06,680
I go wherever the road takes me.

100
00:05:07,959 --> 00:05:09,480
You bear the weight of the throne

101
00:05:10,199 --> 00:05:12,079
and must consider the realm as a whole.

102
00:05:13,399 --> 00:05:14,040
Your Majesty!

103
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:14,680
Your Majesty!

104
00:05:15,079 --> 00:05:15,480
Your...

105
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,120
Your Majesty!

106
00:05:17,439 --> 00:05:18,040
What is it?

107
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,639
Concubine Yu's personal maid...

108
00:05:22,079 --> 00:05:22,920
Consort Chen...

109
00:05:23,759 --> 00:05:25,160
had her dismembered.

110
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:37,439
Today is the anniversary
of the late Empress's death.

111
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:39,720
She dared spill blood
in a place like this...

112
00:05:40,399 --> 00:05:42,040
Consort Chen has become

113
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:44,800
more brazen by the year.

114
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:56,079
Once the seed of bloodshed is sown,

115
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:58,240
retribution may not come at once.

116
00:05:58,959 --> 00:06:00,519
But once the cause is set in motion,

117
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:01,519
the consequence

118
00:06:02,399 --> 00:06:03,560
will come sooner or later.

119
00:06:19,870 --> 00:06:24,060
♪Sunset fades beyond the lonely city♪

120
00:06:24,190 --> 00:06:27,800
♪Dusk snow paints the green hills♪

121
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:30,640
♪A lone rider storms the old pass♪

122
00:06:30,670 --> 00:06:32,950
♪Drunk, I gaze by lamplight♪

123
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:36,830
♪Old friends have all drifted away♪

124
00:06:37,230 --> 00:06:40,590
♪My broken sword rusts, as do I♪

125
00:06:41,510 --> 00:06:45,030
♪Jackdaws cry into the night♪

126
00:06:45,530 --> 00:06:48,090
♪Half a banner snaps in the wind♪

127
00:06:48,220 --> 00:06:50,250
♪In dreams, I return to the camps♪

128
00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:54,100
♪Moonlight chills my armor♪

129
00:06:54,450 --> 00:06:58,780
♪Life is a dream through many winters♪

130
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:02,510
♪I gaze beyond the edge of the world♪

131
00:07:02,690 --> 00:07:05,540
♪Parting sorrow spills across the moon♪

132
00:07:05,610 --> 00:07:11,220
♪The moon and wind mean nothing now♪

133
00:07:11,260 --> 00:07:14,280
♪History turns to ash before ink dries♪

134
00:07:14,320 --> 00:07:20,330
♪Who plays the zither
and sighs at the pavilion?♪

135
00:07:20,990 --> 00:07:27,950
♪The past has faded away♪

136
00:07:27,950 --> 00:07:31,950
♪The past has faded away♪
